WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:20.251
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:20.521 --> 03:25.521
DELUSION

3
03:36.855 --> 03:37.771
Where's Yod?

4
03:38.480 --> 03:40.188
He said he'd let me go home.

5
03:40.271 --> 03:41.521
So when do I get to go home?

6
03:41.605 --> 03:43.021
Soon, sir.

7
03:44.188 --> 03:46.563
There's something I'd like you to help me with.

8
03:51.146 --> 03:52.146
Okay.

9
03:54.813 --> 03:57.021
You worked for the district office, didn't you?

10
03:57.105 --> 03:57.938
Yes.

11
03:58.980 --> 04:01.146
Wow, you were pretty high up.

12
04:01.646 --> 04:02.521
Yes.

13
04:07.063 --> 04:07.896
Sir…

14
04:09.771 --> 04:11.730
Tell me about Phii Pong.

15
04:14.146 --> 04:15.271
What happened back then?

16
04:17.188 --> 04:18.021
Hey,

17
04:18.646 --> 04:20.771
who did it take this time?

18
04:24.188 --> 04:25.771
A boy named Mued, sir.

19
04:26.313 --> 04:27.230
Paew's grandson.

20
04:30.146 --> 04:31.480
Paew's grandson.

21
04:34.230 --> 04:35.980
Since when did Paew have a grandson?

22
04:37.230 --> 04:39.105
Her son isn't even married yet.

23
04:41.563 --> 04:42.521
That's okay, sir.

24
04:43.146 --> 04:44.021
No worries.

25
04:45.105 --> 04:45.980
Then,

26
04:46.938 --> 04:48.188
can you tell me…

27
04:49.438 --> 04:50.938
who the Phii Pong is?

28
04:53.438 --> 04:54.271
Hey.

29
04:55.313 --> 04:56.688
Everyone thinks

30
04:57.563 --> 04:59.313
the ghost only possesses adults.

31
05:00.230 --> 05:01.980
But the truth is, it possesses children.

32
05:05.063 --> 05:06.021
Children?

33
05:06.105 --> 05:07.105
That's right.

34
05:09.271 --> 05:10.813
You mean your grandson?

35
05:13.521 --> 05:14.355
Grandson?

36
05:15.105 --> 05:15.980
Who?

37
05:18.355 --> 05:20.938
Your daughter's son.

38
05:21.021 --> 05:23.146
He went into the forest with you last night.

39
05:24.605 --> 05:26.063
Is Aim the Phii Pong, sir?

40
05:28.105 --> 05:28.938
I don't know.

41
05:29.813 --> 05:31.688
I only know it was a child.

42
05:31.771 --> 05:34.021
I don't know whose child.

43
05:35.980 --> 05:38.438
Are we done now? I'm going home.

44
05:38.521 --> 05:41.438
Not yet, sir. Just a moment. We're not finished yet.

45
05:42.063 --> 05:44.313
Let me go! Why are you keeping me here?

46
05:45.313 --> 05:46.980
I was a government official!

47
05:48.021 --> 05:49.480
-Please calm down. -Let go.

48
05:49.563 --> 05:50.480
Let me go!

49
05:50.563 --> 05:52.480
Calm down. I haven't done anything.

50
05:52.563 --> 05:55.063
I don't care how important you are.

51
05:55.146 --> 05:57.688
I haven't done anything wrong. Let me go!

52
05:58.188 --> 06:00.646
Sergeant, could you take a DNA sample?

53
06:01.646 --> 06:02.688
Nee.

54
06:03.688 --> 06:04.688
Nee!

55
06:04.771 --> 06:06.855
Come talk to these people.

56
06:06.938 --> 06:08.855
Come here, Nee!

57
06:08.938 --> 06:11.730
CHIANG KHAN HOSPITAL

58
06:15.771 --> 06:17.438
Why did you let him be around Aim?

59
06:19.355 --> 06:20.896
The police told me everything.

60
06:23.938 --> 06:25.855
You're lucky I'm not pressing charges.

61
06:26.855 --> 06:28.105
For what?

62
06:29.605 --> 06:31.063
For playing with his grandson?

63
06:43.855 --> 06:45.271
I'm taking my son home now.

64
06:48.271 --> 06:51.480
You'll just leave him at your mom's while you go somewhere else.

65
06:52.563 --> 06:54.313
Why don't you just let him stay with me?

66
06:55.271 --> 06:56.730
He never told you?

67
06:56.813 --> 06:58.438
He doesn't like it there.

68
07:02.146 --> 07:05.230
It's safer than a house with a crazy man wandering around.

69
07:12.896 --> 07:13.896
If we get divorced,

70
07:15.605 --> 07:16.980
he'll end up with me.

71
07:19.105 --> 07:22.646
A poor family like yours? How are you going to raise him properly?

72
07:23.355 --> 07:25.146
You can't even keep him safe.

73
07:27.646 --> 07:28.480
I may be poor,

74
07:29.980 --> 07:32.521
but I never abandoned my son to sleep around.

75
07:34.730 --> 07:36.105
I'm only seeing one person.

76
07:39.480 --> 07:40.646
I'm happy with her.

77
07:42.396 --> 07:43.980
Wan, stop making things up.

78
07:45.105 --> 07:47.271
People will think she's my mistress.

79
07:50.605 --> 07:52.188
Just agree to the divorce.

80
07:56.563 --> 07:57.688
Everyone can see…

81
07:59.396 --> 08:01.146
that we don't love each other anymore.

82
08:09.980 --> 08:11.021
Dad.

83
08:11.771 --> 08:13.313
-Aim. -Hi, Dad.

84
08:13.396 --> 08:15.105
How are you, Son?

85
08:16.855 --> 08:17.980
Are you hurt, Son?

86
08:20.146 --> 08:22.105
Let's stay at my place tonight.

87
08:22.771 --> 08:23.605
Alright.

88
08:24.605 --> 08:27.105
You had me so worried. Let me see how you're doing.

89
08:28.355 --> 08:29.896
Okay.

90
08:32.980 --> 08:35.646
2014 MURDER CASES CASES 1-10

91
08:43.188 --> 08:44.021
Inspector.

92
08:50.438 --> 08:53.521
Are these all the cases people blamed on a ghost?

93
08:53.605 --> 08:54.688
Yes, Inspector.

94
08:54.771 --> 08:55.771
That's all there is.

95
08:56.605 --> 08:58.313
We don't get many major cases.

96
09:08.730 --> 09:09.688
MURDER CASE FILE

97
09:10.896 --> 09:14.521
This is it. The Phii Pong case from over ten years ago.

98
09:30.563 --> 09:34.230
THONGDEE SUMPLOY - COMPLAINANT POL. LT. SOMSAK PATHAM - RECORDING OFFICER

99
09:42.646 --> 09:44.980
Don't scratch, it'll leave a scar.

100
09:46.896 --> 09:48.396
But it's itchy, Mom.

101
09:51.480 --> 09:52.396
Does it hurt?

102
09:54.146 --> 09:55.730
Not that much.

103
09:56.521 --> 09:59.646
When I split my chin at Jae Ki's house, that hurt way more.

104
10:00.563 --> 10:01.813
Let me see.

105
10:05.771 --> 10:06.938
The doctor did a good job.

106
10:07.021 --> 10:07.855
Ouch.

107
10:11.855 --> 10:13.146
-Aim. -Yes?

108
10:14.646 --> 10:15.896
I'm sorry.

109
10:18.355 --> 10:20.355
Why are you apologizing, Mom?

110
10:22.480 --> 10:24.480
You didn't do anything wrong.

111
10:28.563 --> 10:30.313
Why did you follow Grandpa to the forest?

112
10:34.188 --> 10:38.938
I just wanted to know if Grandpa really was a Phii Pong.

113
10:40.813 --> 10:42.355
He's sick.

114
10:42.980 --> 10:44.396
We talked about this.

115
10:45.605 --> 10:48.105
I wanted proof.

116
10:48.980 --> 10:51.730
So if people say things about Grandpa,

117
10:51.813 --> 10:53.813
I can show it to them.

118
10:58.146 --> 10:58.980
And did he…

119
11:00.063 --> 11:01.605
do anything to you?

120
11:04.355 --> 11:06.771
How did you end up in the water?

121
11:13.355 --> 11:14.938
Go home with your dad.

122
11:15.021 --> 11:18.605
I'll stay here with Grandpa and come home as soon as I can.

123
11:18.688 --> 11:19.605
Okay.

124
11:19.688 --> 11:20.521
Let's go.

125
11:27.313 --> 11:28.605
Wat, I'll call you back.

126
11:29.271 --> 11:30.146
Aim.

127
11:33.063 --> 11:33.980
Forgot something?

128
11:37.813 --> 11:39.146
-Bye. -See you, Son.

129
11:39.938 --> 11:41.021
I'll call you.

130
11:41.980 --> 11:42.813
Let's go.

131
11:59.813 --> 12:01.355
About the Phii Pong case…

132
12:01.438 --> 12:03.021
Are you the only one who knows?

133
12:03.688 --> 12:04.521
Yes.

134
12:05.355 --> 12:06.188
Back then,

135
12:06.271 --> 12:07.938
there were only a few officers.

136
12:08.021 --> 12:10.021
The rest either died or got transferred.

137
12:10.105 --> 12:11.563
What do you think?

138
12:12.563 --> 12:13.521
About what?

139
12:16.146 --> 12:17.771
Who did it? A ghost or a human?

140
12:21.105 --> 12:23.855
I'm a country boy, but I'm not superstitious, Inspector.

141
12:24.521 --> 12:27.855
There wasn't a single piece of evidence linking anyone to it.

142
12:28.688 --> 12:32.105
So I did wonder if it really was a ghost.

143
12:32.646 --> 12:34.230
You come from the city.

144
12:34.313 --> 12:36.438
You must think we're ridiculous, don't you?

145
13:05.813 --> 13:06.646
Sis.

146
13:07.230 --> 13:08.980
They want to keep Dad here.

147
13:10.438 --> 13:11.355
What the hell?

148
13:12.480 --> 13:13.480
Can they do that?

149
13:15.271 --> 13:17.980
I actually think it's better if Dad stays here.

150
13:18.771 --> 13:20.896
If someone dies or gets hurt while he's here,

151
13:20.980 --> 13:24.021
people will stop saying Dad's a ghost.

152
13:24.980 --> 13:26.188
What about Mom?

153
13:26.271 --> 13:28.355
She's here too.

154
13:28.438 --> 13:31.605
I'm about to take her home. I'll see you there.

155
14:03.146 --> 14:04.771
Did he move here?

156
14:04.855 --> 14:05.896
Yes, Inspector.

157
14:14.980 --> 14:15.813
Excuse me.

158
14:19.396 --> 14:20.230
Are you Thongdee?

159
14:20.313 --> 14:21.646
That's right.

160
14:21.730 --> 14:23.396
This is our new inspector.

161
14:23.480 --> 14:24.521
Hello.

162
14:25.230 --> 14:26.813
I'm here to ask about your son.

163
14:31.605 --> 14:32.896
I didn't think much of it.

164
14:32.980 --> 14:36.355
Kids around here always go off to play in the fields.

165
14:37.605 --> 14:39.188
If I'd known there was a ghost,

166
14:40.063 --> 14:41.146
I wouldn't have let him go.

167
14:42.813 --> 14:44.605
Please think carefully.

168
14:44.688 --> 14:47.605
Did anyone from outside the village move here around that time?

169
14:50.563 --> 14:52.230
No, Officer.

170
14:53.730 --> 14:56.688
Other than the Phii Pong, did you suspect anyone else?

171
15:17.188 --> 15:18.313
There are no ghosts.

172
15:19.938 --> 15:21.980
What kind of ghost goes around killing children?

173
15:23.771 --> 15:24.855
The police were just lazy.

174
15:24.938 --> 15:27.855
They all started saying that so they wouldn't have to work.

175
15:27.938 --> 15:29.105
Bua.

176
15:29.188 --> 15:30.563
I don't believe

177
15:30.646 --> 15:32.105
a ghost killed my son.

178
15:32.188 --> 15:34.230
Then who do you think did it?

179
15:34.313 --> 15:36.396
I don't know. Isn't that your job?

180
15:38.146 --> 15:40.938
Who was the first person to bring up the Phii Pong?

181
15:41.771 --> 15:45.396
If not the police, then it was one of the local shamans.

182
15:45.480 --> 15:47.855
They kept repeating that for over ten years,

183
15:47.938 --> 15:51.563
until no one cared about finding my son's killer.

184
15:58.688 --> 15:59.771
I'm sorry, Officer.

185
16:24.646 --> 16:26.688
Just heat up the leftovers.

186
16:26.771 --> 16:29.396
I didn't have time to cook. The whole day's been wasted.

187
16:29.480 --> 16:33.313
I'll heat it up. Do you have to take your medicine before a meal?

188
16:33.396 --> 16:35.521
Are you doing anything tonight?

189
16:35.605 --> 16:38.271
Take me to the police station this evening.

190
16:39.771 --> 16:41.105
Your father's there alone.

191
16:41.188 --> 16:43.813
If he has another episode, the police might beat him.

192
16:47.396 --> 16:48.438
I'll go.

193
16:49.521 --> 16:51.771
See? Everything's become such a hassle.

194
16:52.355 --> 16:55.355
That's why I told you not to get the police involved.

195
16:55.438 --> 16:57.688
See? They locked him up.

196
16:57.771 --> 16:59.271
Now everyone will gossip.

197
17:01.271 --> 17:02.771
Here, put these in the fridge.

198
17:07.938 --> 17:08.771
Wan.

199
17:08.855 --> 17:11.105
Can you lend me 50,000 baht?

200
17:13.355 --> 17:14.188
I don't have it.

201
17:15.313 --> 17:18.730
You don't? Then ask your husband.

202
17:18.813 --> 17:20.355
His family's loaded.

203
17:21.021 --> 17:23.480
And don't you have any savings?

204
17:25.313 --> 17:28.146
I've been sending you my savings all this time.

205
17:28.230 --> 17:29.313
Don't you remember?

206
17:30.313 --> 17:32.271
Or are you getting dementia too?

207
17:35.730 --> 17:37.063
Take your medicine.

208
17:57.771 --> 17:59.146
Wan, let me help.

209
18:00.730 --> 18:01.896
Come on. I'll help you.

210
18:03.896 --> 18:06.605
Will this be enough? I can fry an egg if you want more.

211
18:07.146 --> 18:08.146
No, this is enough.

212
18:09.896 --> 18:12.230
No, it's not. Her son needs to eat too.

213
18:21.730 --> 18:23.355
Hey, got any chilies?

214
18:23.980 --> 18:27.730
Let's put lots in and make it really spicy like we used to when we were kids.

215
18:27.813 --> 18:29.105
Do you remember?

216
18:44.605 --> 18:47.855
Hey, about Dad's medical bills,

217
18:48.730 --> 18:50.021
I'll help pay for them.

218
18:51.563 --> 18:54.771
And about the money Mom wants to borrow,

219
18:55.521 --> 18:56.521
I'll wire it to you.

220
18:58.188 --> 18:59.730
You can pass it onto her.

221
19:00.563 --> 19:02.980
If you're going to lend it to her, just give it to her.

222
19:03.730 --> 19:05.105
You don't need to go through me.

223
19:08.230 --> 19:11.521
If you're lending it, don't give her the whole amount.

224
19:12.313 --> 19:13.146
Keep some…

225
19:14.646 --> 19:16.771
in case Dad really has to go to a facility.

226
19:22.271 --> 19:25.646
Did Aim say who made him fall into the water?

227
19:27.355 --> 19:30.021
It wasn't Dad, was it?

228
19:31.521 --> 19:33.938
Aim said he slipped, and the current carried him away.

229
19:34.980 --> 19:37.605
Dad tried to save him, but he couldn't.

230
19:39.105 --> 19:40.271
I see.

231
19:52.980 --> 19:54.646
The cause of death…

232
19:54.730 --> 19:58.105
was severe blunt force trauma to the head.

233
19:58.188 --> 20:00.480
We found no defensive wounds.

234
20:00.563 --> 20:02.480
So it's very likely…

235
20:03.188 --> 20:05.146
that he died from a single blow,

236
20:05.230 --> 20:07.021
or it knocked him out immediately.

237
20:12.188 --> 20:14.105
Sergeant, you can leave if it's too much.

238
20:14.188 --> 20:15.313
Okay, I'm leaving now.

239
20:17.188 --> 20:18.271
What about his abdomen?

240
20:24.271 --> 20:26.980
The abdominal wound was a postmortem wound.

241
20:27.063 --> 20:29.688
It was inflicted after death.

242
20:30.771 --> 20:34.021
Can you tell what weapon the killer used?

243
20:35.563 --> 20:36.896
It's hard to say, Inspector.

244
20:36.980 --> 20:39.688
Right now, all we know is that it was a sharp, solid object.

245
20:40.896 --> 20:44.396
If possible, I'd like you to find the suspected weapon…

246
20:44.480 --> 20:45.938
so I can compare it to the wound.

247
20:47.730 --> 20:48.563
Understood.

248
20:49.313 --> 20:52.313
Oh, and the amphetamine test came back positive.

249
21:01.813 --> 21:04.563
WOUND ASSESSMENT FORM ANUPONG NALAH

250
21:18.521 --> 21:21.021
Do you think it's possible the killer was the same person?

251
21:26.980 --> 21:29.855
This is another case from over ten years ago.

252
21:30.605 --> 21:34.480
The victim's teeth were missing too.

253
21:37.396 --> 21:40.688
The two cases look very similar,

254
21:40.771 --> 21:42.605
especially the missing teeth.

255
21:44.688 --> 21:47.646
Why don't you go back to the crime scene?

256
21:48.146 --> 21:50.063
You might find more evidence.

257
22:00.980 --> 22:02.313
Sergeant,

258
22:03.396 --> 22:04.688
follow up on the evidence…

259
22:11.646 --> 22:12.980
I'll get going then.

260
22:16.188 --> 22:17.480
Your coffee.

261
22:25.313 --> 22:26.813
The villagers are scared.

262
22:27.563 --> 22:29.063
They asked us to keep him here.

263
22:31.271 --> 22:33.396
But he hasn't been charged, has he?

264
22:40.105 --> 22:40.938
The thing is…

265
22:42.688 --> 22:45.271
we found a gray hair on the victim.

266
22:45.355 --> 22:49.896
Your father was closest to the scene, so he's become a suspect.

267
22:49.980 --> 22:53.646
We've sent it for DNA testing. If it doesn't match, then it's fine.

268
22:57.230 --> 22:59.855
Do you really think someone in my father's condition…

269
23:02.355 --> 23:04.396
could hurt anyone?

270
23:05.855 --> 23:07.230
It's funny, isn't it?

271
23:08.146 --> 23:11.521
Even in this day and age, people still believe in Phii Pong.

272
23:12.980 --> 23:14.813
What did you know about it back then?

273
23:16.938 --> 23:17.938
I didn't pay attention.

274
23:20.313 --> 23:22.188
Someone was killed near your house.

275
23:22.271 --> 23:23.646
Weren't you scared?

276
23:25.480 --> 23:26.480
No.

277
23:27.438 --> 23:29.230
I don't believe in those things.

278
23:30.063 --> 23:33.021
Did the villagers suspect anyone then, or were there any rumors…

279
23:33.105 --> 23:34.688
about who the Phii Pong was?

280
23:36.188 --> 23:37.313
No.

281
23:40.396 --> 23:42.980
I only remember that people started hanging effigies.

282
23:44.688 --> 23:47.188
Did your family hang one? You have a younger brother.

283
23:52.063 --> 23:52.896
Yes.

284
23:54.271 --> 23:55.480
My mother hung one.

285
23:56.563 --> 24:00.021
But my father didn't really believe in it. He just went along with it.

286
24:02.146 --> 24:04.313
He sent my brother to study in Bangkok after that.

287
24:12.230 --> 24:14.563
MURDER CASE FILE

288
24:17.730 --> 24:20.646
You're from Bangkok. Do you believe in ghosts too?

289
24:26.021 --> 24:28.105
But you seem really interested in all this.

290
24:28.855 --> 24:32.438
I'm starting to think you believe my father really is a ghost.

291
24:35.355 --> 24:36.813
I hope that's not the case.

292
24:40.313 --> 24:44.396
That way, I'll know my father will get justice.

293
24:53.146 --> 24:54.438
-Open up. -What's wrong now?

294
24:55.105 --> 24:55.980
Open the door.

295
24:57.021 --> 24:58.063
Open.

296
24:58.146 --> 24:59.230
Open!

297
24:59.313 --> 25:00.313
Dad.

298
25:01.396 --> 25:03.771
Hang on. They're about to open it.

299
25:03.855 --> 25:06.521
Why are you locking me up?

300
25:07.105 --> 25:08.188
You're not locked up.

301
25:10.730 --> 25:12.230
You're helping the police.

302
25:12.980 --> 25:15.605
It's confidential, so we must lock the door.

303
25:20.938 --> 25:22.396
What else do you need?

304
25:23.771 --> 25:25.355
I need to use the bathroom.

305
25:27.396 --> 25:28.355
Open the door.

306
25:29.355 --> 25:30.188
Open it.

307
25:37.563 --> 25:39.271
Go with the officer, Dad.

308
25:39.355 --> 25:40.480
I will wait here.

309
25:50.730 --> 25:53.480
If you have a way to keep your father from wandering off,

310
25:54.146 --> 25:56.313
I can arrange his release…

311
25:59.105 --> 26:00.480
so you can get some rest.

312
26:48.730 --> 26:51.813
Tying him up like this won't hurt?

313
26:54.521 --> 26:57.230
We'll have to do this for now.

314
26:58.146 --> 27:01.813
But I'll get some softer restraints from psychiatry.

315
27:03.146 --> 27:05.605
I've adjusted his medication too.

316
27:06.271 --> 27:08.355
If his mood stabilizes,

317
27:09.230 --> 27:10.771
we won't have to restrain him.

318
27:17.105 --> 27:18.771
I'll stay with him tonight.

319
27:19.896 --> 27:22.146
You should sleep in your room.

320
27:41.855 --> 27:44.813
I put 100 baht in the envelope for Grannie.

321
27:46.105 --> 27:49.230
I remember it now. It was exactly like this.

322
27:50.021 --> 27:53.021
Did you go to the cremation?

323
27:53.105 --> 27:54.021
Yes.

324
27:54.105 --> 27:55.146
-Did you go? -Yes.

325
27:56.230 --> 27:57.396
I did.

326
28:08.646 --> 28:09.688
This is my donation.

327
28:28.021 --> 28:30.855
BORN 9 SEPTEMBER 2011 DIED 31 OCTOBER 2026

328
28:32.230 --> 28:33.230
What are you making?

329
28:34.146 --> 28:35.105
Fish porridge.

330
28:37.521 --> 28:39.355
Here, let me help.

331
28:48.521 --> 28:49.688
Nee.

332
28:50.521 --> 28:51.563
Where's your husband?

333
28:55.813 --> 28:56.646
At home.

334
28:57.313 --> 28:59.105
Wat took leave to stay with him.

335
29:00.730 --> 29:02.605
The police already released him?

336
29:06.105 --> 29:08.605
What if he wanders off again, Nee?

337
29:10.938 --> 29:13.230
Why didn't you leave him with the police?

338
29:14.063 --> 29:17.396
Now that he's been released, what if the ghost possesses him again?

339
29:20.271 --> 29:21.521
Hello, Shaman Sak.

340
29:21.605 --> 29:22.938
Hello.

341
29:25.646 --> 29:26.896
I'm sorry for your loss.

342
29:45.271 --> 29:47.521
Human teeth are tiny.

343
29:48.396 --> 29:49.896
How are we supposed to find them?

344
29:51.688 --> 29:53.021
How many teeth are missing?

345
29:54.896 --> 29:55.855
How many?

346
29:57.563 --> 29:58.396
Five.

347
29:58.938 --> 30:02.105
Two incisors, one canine, and two premolars.

348
30:07.438 --> 30:08.271
Ready?

349
30:08.938 --> 30:10.980
Inspector, the drone's ready.

350
30:24.896 --> 30:26.896
Mued came pretty deep into the forest.

351
30:38.855 --> 30:39.688
Hold on.

352
30:41.605 --> 30:42.855
What is this?

353
31:01.855 --> 31:03.146
-Senior Sergeant. -Yes, sir?

354
31:03.230 --> 31:05.480
Back then, no one knew this house was here?

355
31:06.105 --> 31:08.480
You couldn't get this deep into the forest then, Inspector.

356
31:10.980 --> 31:14.021
So no one knows who built it?

357
33:16.771 --> 33:19.771
Today, we're going to find out the truth

358
33:19.855 --> 33:22.605
behind the Phii Pong

359
33:23.105 --> 33:24.063
of Na sao Village.

360
33:24.146 --> 33:24.980
Nee.

361
33:26.146 --> 33:27.355
Are you home?

362
33:29.105 --> 33:29.938
Pannee.

363
33:31.521 --> 33:32.688
Are you home, Nee?

364
33:32.771 --> 33:33.646
Who is that?

365
33:34.271 --> 33:35.396
I don't know either.

366
33:51.980 --> 33:53.438
What are you doing here?

367
33:54.188 --> 33:55.813
Let Sak come cast a spell.

368
33:55.896 --> 33:58.396
It's fine. Better safe than sorry.

369
33:59.521 --> 34:00.855
Come on, we're all family.

370
34:00.938 --> 34:02.646
There's no need to do anything.

371
34:04.938 --> 34:07.896
But let me go see Narong for a bit.

372
34:09.896 --> 34:10.938
Come back another day.

373
34:11.563 --> 34:12.688
He's already asleep.

374
34:15.313 --> 34:17.188
Are you alone with him?

375
34:18.980 --> 34:20.188
What about Wat?

376
34:20.271 --> 34:21.563
Wat's gone to work.

377
34:22.396 --> 34:23.313
You should leave.

378
34:23.396 --> 34:25.688
You're being too loud. You'll wake Narong.

379
34:28.438 --> 34:29.730
Who is that?

380
34:33.355 --> 34:34.896
Let me go!

381
34:36.396 --> 34:37.230
Let go!

382
34:37.730 --> 34:41.563
-Sadhu… -Damn you.

383
34:42.146 --> 34:44.396
-Let me go. -Truly, the Blessed One is worthy.

384
34:44.480 --> 34:48.313
I bow in reverence to the Buddha, the Blessed One.

385
34:50.146 --> 34:51.938
I said let me go.

386
34:56.771 --> 34:59.146
Inspector, we found another tooth.

387
35:07.813 --> 35:09.021
Where Mued's body was found

388
35:10.188 --> 35:11.896
and where Thongdee's son was found…

389
35:12.521 --> 35:14.730
They're both not far from the shack.

390
35:27.730 --> 35:28.605
Guts.

391
35:29.313 --> 35:30.188
Teeth.

392
35:30.271 --> 35:31.605
Blunt force to the head.

393
35:33.271 --> 35:34.105
Phii Pong.

394
35:39.188 --> 35:42.021
Sergeant, take me to that shaman.

395
36:01.480 --> 36:03.355
How about you skip taekwondo today?

396
36:04.188 --> 36:05.521
Let's go have hot pot.

397
36:07.230 --> 36:08.813
Maybe another day, Mom.

398
36:09.730 --> 36:12.605
My red belt test is coming up. I'm worried I won't pass.

399
36:14.980 --> 36:16.730
You sure you'll be okay?

400
36:17.730 --> 36:18.646
I'll be fine.

401
36:24.521 --> 36:25.646
Wanna go to Grandpa's?

402
36:27.730 --> 36:28.563
Do you want to?

403
36:32.480 --> 36:35.271
I have to work tomorrow. We can go together.

404
36:42.480 --> 36:43.313
Okay.

405
36:44.063 --> 36:45.188
You tell Dad.

406
36:50.188 --> 36:51.813
Fine, stay with your father.

407
36:53.230 --> 36:55.396
If you come, you'll have to wake up earlier.

408
36:55.896 --> 36:57.438
We'll see each other tomorrow, okay?

409
37:10.730 --> 37:11.855
Hello, Grandma.

410
37:14.313 --> 37:15.730
I see your car.

411
37:16.771 --> 37:17.896
I'm coming out.

412
37:23.730 --> 37:27.480
Dad gave me his old phone to use.

413
37:44.563 --> 37:47.980
Chew carefully, or you'll choke.

414
37:48.063 --> 37:51.146
If you eat like that before class, won't your stomach hurt?

415
37:54.146 --> 37:56.146
See you tomorrow, Mom.

416
38:08.646 --> 38:09.480
Hello.

417
38:12.188 --> 38:13.813
Did Yote drive you here?

418
38:14.980 --> 38:16.188
He was busy.

419
38:18.938 --> 38:19.980
With what?

420
38:23.063 --> 38:24.896
He told me he'd pick Aim up himself.

421
38:25.938 --> 38:27.938
If he's really busy, he could've just told me

422
38:28.021 --> 38:29.146
so we wouldn't trouble you.

423
38:30.438 --> 38:31.563
Trouble me how?

424
38:33.563 --> 38:35.605
Yote had something urgent come up.

425
38:36.688 --> 38:38.063
But don't worry, Wan.

426
38:39.188 --> 38:41.646
I won't let Aim fall into the water.

427
38:44.938 --> 38:45.896
I should get going.

428
38:45.980 --> 38:47.188
Aim's going to be late.

429
39:38.521 --> 39:39.771
What the hell?

430
39:56.646 --> 39:58.605
-Yote. -Don't come out. There's glass.

431
40:12.188 --> 40:13.021
YOTE

432
40:20.771 --> 40:22.355
YOTE

433
40:26.146 --> 40:27.105
YOTE

434
40:39.105 --> 40:42.813
YOTE

435
40:46.480 --> 40:49.646
Wan, I never thought you could sink this low.

436
40:49.730 --> 40:51.980
We've never gone after you.

437
40:52.063 --> 40:54.105
Let me tell you something. No matter what you do,

438
40:54.188 --> 40:55.605
even if you hold a gun to my head,

439
40:57.063 --> 40:58.355
you'll get nothing from me.

440
41:08.646 --> 41:09.730
There's nothing left…

441
41:11.188 --> 41:12.480
between you and me.

442
41:14.021 --> 41:15.980
I never meant to hurt you.

443
41:16.896 --> 41:18.896
But if you want to play dirty like this,

444
41:19.396 --> 41:20.271
so can I.

445
41:23.230 --> 41:24.063
My money?

446
41:25.063 --> 41:26.230
You won't get a single baht.

447
41:27.938 --> 41:28.771
You'll never see…

448
41:29.521 --> 41:30.563
our child again.

449
41:52.230 --> 41:53.146
Sergeant.

450
41:59.355 --> 42:01.896
-Hello, sir. -Hello, what's up?

451
42:03.355 --> 42:04.771
Have you been drinking?

452
42:07.605 --> 42:09.230
I just transferred here.

453
42:09.313 --> 42:12.188
I asked him to bring me here to pay my respects for good luck.

454
42:13.480 --> 42:15.646
What should I call him, Sergeant?

455
42:16.271 --> 42:17.480
Shaman or Master?

456
42:19.063 --> 42:20.896
My family calls him…

457
42:20.980 --> 42:22.563
Just call me sir.

458
42:24.521 --> 42:26.230
And what's your name, Officer?

459
42:26.313 --> 42:27.730
I'm Pete.

460
42:52.855 --> 42:54.688
How long have you been doing this, sir?

461
42:56.396 --> 42:57.563
Quite a while.

462
42:57.646 --> 42:59.063
Several decades.

463
43:01.188 --> 43:03.063
Ever since the Phii Pong…

464
43:03.980 --> 43:06.021
killed Thongdee's son?

465
43:07.896 --> 43:08.855
Maybe.

466
43:09.980 --> 43:11.438
I don't remember.

467
43:19.146 --> 43:20.813
Did you know a boy named Mued?

468
43:22.688 --> 43:24.105
I'm working on his case.

469
43:24.813 --> 43:26.438
Everyone keeps saying…

470
43:28.230 --> 43:31.646
it's just like when the Phii Pong was killing people back then.

471
43:32.605 --> 43:34.438
So I came to get information from you.

472
43:40.438 --> 43:42.438
I don't know that much.

473
43:44.313 --> 43:47.855
I just heard the stories passed down by the elders.

474
43:48.480 --> 43:49.646
That's all.

475
43:53.188 --> 43:56.105
So it existed even before children were killed ten years ago?

476
43:58.563 --> 43:59.938
It's an ancient ghost.

477
44:01.355 --> 44:04.313
Everyone around here knows about it.

478
44:06.646 --> 44:07.521
Really, Sergeant?

479
44:08.605 --> 44:09.480
Yes, sir.

480
44:12.438 --> 44:17.688
But you didn't tell me everything. You said it only eats people's organs.

481
44:19.521 --> 44:21.313
But the body we found…

482
44:22.105 --> 44:23.855
had other things missing too.

483
44:33.855 --> 44:38.188
A ghost eats whatever it can grab.

484
44:38.271 --> 44:40.313
There's only one thing to watch out for.

485
44:40.813 --> 44:42.438
Don't let anyone who's seen it…

486
44:43.230 --> 44:45.396
tell others who it really is.

487
44:46.521 --> 44:50.396
Otherwise, the host will die.

488
44:52.271 --> 44:54.355
This ghost is a lot like a thief, isn't it?

489
45:01.105 --> 45:02.271
I should get going.

490
45:02.855 --> 45:03.771
Let's go, Sergeant.

491
45:04.771 --> 45:06.646
It was nice meeting you.

492
45:08.438 --> 45:09.480
Hold on.

493
45:13.896 --> 45:15.188
Here.

494
45:16.896 --> 45:19.146
Keep it.

495
45:20.230 --> 45:21.605
It'll ward off ghosts…

496
45:21.688 --> 45:22.980
and anything evil.

497
45:24.646 --> 45:25.480
Thank you.

498
45:59.771 --> 46:02.271
SRI CHIANG KHAN STREET, SOI 19

499
46:13.146 --> 46:14.771
Two porridges, one steamed rice.

500
46:14.855 --> 46:15.730
Sure.

501
46:17.855 --> 46:19.480
Have a beer.

502
46:20.105 --> 46:21.188
I'll drive.

503
46:27.396 --> 46:29.146
Are you sure, Inspector?

504
46:30.105 --> 46:31.230
I won't say it twice.

505
46:31.313 --> 46:33.105
-Miss, two beers, please. -Okay.

506
46:57.313 --> 46:58.146
Here.

507
46:59.230 --> 47:00.521
That's all I have.

508
47:00.605 --> 47:01.855
I've got nothing left.

509
47:11.105 --> 47:12.396
Why so little?

510
47:18.188 --> 47:19.271
Hello.

511
47:19.855 --> 47:20.855
Sasidit speaking.

512
47:21.605 --> 47:24.146
Inspector, the DNA results are back.

513
47:25.896 --> 47:28.188
The DNA doesn't match Mr. Narong's.

514
47:29.438 --> 47:32.021
I've sent some additional information by email.

515
47:32.605 --> 47:33.563
Please have a look.

516
47:35.646 --> 47:37.980
These cases happened in other provinces.

517
47:38.813 --> 47:41.855
But in every case, the victim's teeth are missing too.

518
47:54.521 --> 47:55.771
That piece of land…

519
47:56.563 --> 47:58.063
is just sitting there doing nothing.

520
47:59.896 --> 48:00.896
Transfer it to me.

521
48:01.896 --> 48:04.646
You've already taken enough. I won't give it to you.

522
48:05.313 --> 48:06.271
Got it?

523
48:21.855 --> 48:24.063
What did you know about it back then?

524
48:24.688 --> 48:28.355
I only remember people started hanging effigies.

525
48:30.063 --> 48:30.980
MUED

526
48:31.063 --> 48:34.563
If not the police, then it was one of the local shamans.

527
48:35.188 --> 48:37.230
They kept repeating that for over ten years…

528
48:37.855 --> 48:39.688
How long have you been doing this, sir?

529
48:39.771 --> 48:40.855
Quite a while.

530
48:40.938 --> 48:42.396
Several decades.

531
48:42.480 --> 48:44.521
Ever since the Phii Pong…

532
48:45.563 --> 48:47.146
killed Thongdee's son?

533
54:42.271 --> 54:47.271
Subtitle translation by: Parida Kim
